Lunacy's Sounds & Alerts.

Palm's Sounds & Alerts (com.palm.app.soundsandalerts, webOS 3.x) sets webOS's sounds: a
master switch, the system volume, system sounds, keyboard clicks, the ringtone and its volume,
vibration and Beats Audio. Lunacy owns some of those and Android owns the rest, so this app
keeps Palm's layout and the settings Lunacy really has - Sounds, Volume and System Sounds - and
opens Android's sound settings for the others. It keeps Palm's app id, so it sits where webOS
users expect to find it.

The app's code (source/SoundsAndAlerts.js, index.html, depends.js, appinfo.json) is Lunacy's,
under the same terms as the rest of Lunacy, written against the layout of Palm's
source/SoundsAndAlertsPrefApp.js on the reference TouchPad (webOS CE 3.1.0). These files are
not Lunacy's:

- icon.png, icon-256x256.png, images/soundsandalerts_48x48.png,
  images/light_chrome_drop_shadow_header.png, images/light_chrome_drop_shadow_footer.png and
  stylesheets/soundsandalerts.css

